      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-10-16 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\n科学研究を自律化する「scientific-agent-skills」の台頭とオープンエージェントエコシステムの確立\n\n[出典リンク](https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/Google|Google]]\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/RAG|RAG]]\n- [[Technologies/agentic|agentic]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_ai_dev_tools",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 🛠️ 開発ツール・IDE統合\n\n収集件数: **4件**"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_dev_tools_8de36b2e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills — Turn any AI agent into an AI Scientist. The #1 Agent Skills library for science, used by 250,000+ scientists worldwide. 177 ready-to-use validated skills plus 100+ scientific databases covering biology, chemistry, medicine, and drug discovery. Compatible with Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Pi, Antigravity, and the open Agent Skills standard. (★1158/day)](https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills)**\n_Score: 90_"
    },
    {
      "id": "art_ai_dev_tools_fa038564",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ Imbad0202/academic-research-skills — Academic Research Skills for Claude Code: research → write → review → revise → finalize (★254/day)](https://github.com/Imbad0202/academic-research-skills)**\n_Score: 36_"
