      "x": 940,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 85,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "**[⭐ google/artemis — ARTEMIS turns natural-language instructions into reliable Android automation. It automates end-to-end workflows, captures logs, and integrates seamlessly with AI coding assistants such as Antigravity, Codex, and Claude Code. It also achieves 99%+ success rate on AndroidWorld Benchmark. (★221/day)](https://github.com/google/artemis)**\n_Score: 36_"
    },
